        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Vienna\n- Organizations: Flex\n- People: High Contrast, Lincoln Barrett\n- Topics: Drum and bass, electronic music, Waves Vienna\n\nFacts:\n- Flex is a nightclub in Vienna.\n- Waves Vienna takes place in multiple music venues in Vienna, including Fluc, Flex, and Odeon.\n- High Contrast was born on 18 September 1979.\n- Lincoln Barrett is better known by the stage name High Contrast.\n- High Contrast is a Welsh electronic music producer, DJ, and record producer.\n- Flex has hosted hundreds of visits from drum and bass DJs such as Pendulum, High Contrast, DJ Marky, Aphrodite, Patifee, DJ Hype, Logistics, and Leopoi.",
